    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible-light-mediated, organocatalyzed 1,3-aminoacylation of cyclopropanes using N-benzoyl saccharin as a bifunctional reagent. The system utilizes a dual-catalysis approach with N-heterocyclic carbenes (NHCs) and photoredox catalysts (PCs) to achieve C-N bond addition to cyclopropanes via an oxidative quenching mechanism, overcoming previous limitations regarding the generality of aryl cyclopropane substrates.",
